{"tool":"medusa.admin_post","args":{"path":"/admin/research/artifacts","body":{"record_type":"report","scope_id":"rscope_colander_es","save_key":"competitor-research-colander-es-2026-09-02-v1","report_kind":"competitor_research","schema_revision":"competitor_research/1","runbook_revision":"intgral-research@4","template_revision":"competitor_research@1","skill_revision":"intgral-research/competitor@3","upstream_evidence_ids":["rart_amz_col_01","rart_amz_col_02","rart_amz_col_03","rart_amz_col_04"],"upstream_report_ids":[],"markdown":"# 竞品报告：西班牙站折叠硅胶沥水篮（Amazon.es）\n\n依据：已保存的 4 条列表观测（观测日 2026-09-02），未新采集。\n\n## 结论先行\n- **差评主题：无法回答。** 已保存证据中没有任何评论正文（4 条均标注 review text was not collected），只有评分汇总。评分与评论数不是主题，因此本报告不含任何差评主题。\n- **价格带：** 同口径（EUR、单件、硅胶折叠、运费未知）仅 2 个成员：11.99 EUR 与 14.50 EUR。两个价格不构成价格带，只列出价格。\n\n## 候选竞品\n| ASIN | 品牌 | 规格 | 分类 | 当前价 | 评分（评论数） | 来源 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| [B0FAKE0C01](https://example.test/dp/B0FAKE0C01) | Plegasa | 折叠硅胶 24 cm，灰，1 件 | 直接竞品 | 11.99 EUR | 4.4（812） | rart_amz_col_01，2026-09-02 |\n| [B0FAKE0C02](https://example.test/dp/B0FAKE0C02) | Cocinova | 折叠硅胶 26 cm，绿，1 件 | 直接竞品 | 14.50 EUR（划线价 17.90 EUR，单列） | 4.1（2,304） | rart_amz_col_02，2026-09-02 |\n| [B0FAKE0C03](https://example.test/dp/B0FAKE0C03) | Cocinova | 折叠硅胶 26 cm，绿，2 件装 | 替代（包装口径不同） | 24.90 EUR / 2 件 | 4.1（2,304，沿用父列表） | rart_amz_col_03，2026-09-02 |\n| [B0FAKE0C04](https://example.test/dp/B0FAKE0C04) | Basiq | 硬塑料 25 cm，白，1 件 | 替代（材质不同） | 6.49 EUR | 3.7（97） | rart_amz_col_04，2026-09-02 |\n\n自有品牌 Casa Verde 已按范围排除。C03 为由父列表合成的变体行，其评分与 C02 相同，来自父列表，不是该变体独立评分。\n\n## 价格\n- 直接竞品组（EUR，1 件，硅胶折叠，运费未知并排除）：11.99 EUR（C01）、14.50 EUR（C02）。仅两个观测值，不是价格带。\n- 单列、不并入上组：C02 划线价 17.90 EUR（另一报价）；C03 为 2 件装 24.90 EUR（包装口径不同，按件折算属推断，未提交为结构化数据）；C04 为塑料 6.49 EUR（材质不同）。\n- 推断（非结构化数据）：硬塑料款价格明显低于硅胶折叠款；依据 rart_amz_col_04 与 01/02。\n\n## 差评主题\n**不可用。** 没有保留的评论正文，评分（4.4 / 4.1 / 3.7）与评论数只是计数，不能推出差评原因。不依据星级分布推断任何主题。\n\n## 需求代理指标（不是销量）\n列表徽标下限：C01 “Más de 200 comprados el mes pasado”（下限 200），C02 “Más de 500…”（下限 500），C04 无可读徽标；C03 无。这些是 Amazon 展示的下限，不是销量或市场规模。\n\n## 缺口与下一步\n- 4 个候选均无评论正文；覆盖度为 partial。\n- 下一步（仅提议，未启动）：对 C01、C02（以及 C04，如需）申请有上限的评论采集计划（按精确变体、限定条数），经您批准后执行。","data":{"candidates":[{"evidence_id":"rart_amz_col_01","source_ref":"B0FAKE0C01","classification":"direct","selection_reason":"collapsible silicone colander, single unit","variant":"collapsible silicone colander 24 cm, grey, 1 unit"},{"evidence_id":"rart_amz_col_02","source_ref":"B0FAKE0C02","classification":"direct","selection_reason":"collapsible silicone colander, single unit","variant":"collapsible silicone colander 26 cm, green, 1 unit"},{"evidence_id":"rart_amz_col_03","source_ref":"B0FAKE0C03","classification":"alternative","selection_reason":"same product sold as a set of 2; different pack basis","variant":"collapsible silicone colander 26 cm, green, set of 2"},{"evidence_id":"rart_amz_col_04","source_ref":"B0FAKE0C04","classification":"alternative","selection_reason":"same task but rigid plastic; different material and price tier","variant":"rigid plastic colander 25 cm, white, 1 unit"}],"price_groups":[{"id":"direct-eur-item","label":"Direct single-unit collapsible silicone current prices; shipping unknown and excluded","comparison":{"currency":"EUR","quantity":1,"unit":"item","variant_basis":"collapsible silicone colander single unit","shipping":"excluded_unknown"},"members":[{"evidence_id":"rart_amz_col_01","source_ref":"B0FAKE0C01","offer_id":"current"},{"evidence_id":"rart_amz_col_02","source_ref":"B0FAKE0C02","offer_id":"current"}]}],"review_analysis":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"No original review body is retained; ratings 4.4 (812), 4.1 (2,304), 3.7 (97) are counts, not themes"}},"coverage":{"status":"partial","requested":4,"returned":4,"gaps":["no review bodies retained for any of the 4 candidates; review_analysis unavailable","B0FAKE0C03 variant row synthesised from the parent listing; its rating is the parent's","only two members in the like-for-like price group; not a price band","shipping unknown for all offers"]}}},"isError":false,"response":{"status":201,"artifact":{"id":"rart_report_col_comp_01","version":1,"record_type":"report","report_kind":"competitor_research","scope_id":"rscope_colander_es","created_at":"2026-09-18T08:00:00.000Z"}}}
